\subsubsection{Failure Taxonomy}
We define six failure modes based on structural metric thresholds:
\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{F1 Capillary Dropout}: Missing thin vessels (vessel width < 3px)
    \item \textbf{F2 Branch Merge}: BFR $<$ -0.05 (model loses/merges branches)
    \item \textbf{F3 False Bridge}: False connections across vessel gaps
    \item \textbf{F4 Peripheral Loss}: Vessel loss at image periphery
    \item \textbf{F5 Junction Error}: JPR $<$ 0.5 on individual image
    \item \textbf{F6 Crossing Error}: Incorrect handling of vessel crossings
\end{itemize}

