\subsubsection{Ablation Study: Curriculum Learning and Topological Loss}
To isolate the contributions of our proposed innovations, we conduct an ablation study with four configurations:
\begin{enumerate}
    \item \textbf{A (Baseline)}: No curriculum learning, no topological loss
    \item \textbf{B (+Curriculum)}: Curriculum learning only
    \item \textbf{C (+Topo only)}: Topological loss only
    \item \textbf{D (Full)}: Both curriculum learning and topological loss
\end{enumerate}

